    <statement><p>Add the two rational expressions
<me>\frac{2x-1}{2x^{2}} + \frac{5\mathopen{}\left(x-2\right)}{2x^{2}}.</me>
Express your answer in simplest form <m>\frac{A}{B}</m>.</p>
<p>Answer: <m>A =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/> and <m>B =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left(2+5\right)x-2\cdot 5-1</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2x^{2}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
